{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;STAR FIRE&quot; is a classic side-scrolling shooter centered around intense boss battles. Defeat colossal enemies in beautifully hand-drawn worlds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a magical cat-eared girl, journey through ancient enchanted lands to gather scattered star fragments. Traverse grasslands, forests, oceans, and snow-capped mountains to restore the lost stars to their rightful paths in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</strong><br>All in-game art assets are meticulously hand-painted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/donghua4-1.gif?t=1749518942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfying High-Speed Combat</strong><br>Players nimbly control characters in fast-paced boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/donghua4-3.gif?t=1749518942\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Bullet Patterns</strong><br>Uniquely crafted bullet patterns adapt to each scene\u2019s visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/donghua4-2.gif?t=1749518942\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794670?t=1749518942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5eacd8aba8c6132b6b9874ac96486b40cbcaa569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749518942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5761dfbe0dc835c94775ffcdaa0c15e5bdc767e6/capsu